  "_comment_metro": "Venues within a walk of a Metro station from Tallawong to Central (not Waterloo, Sydenham or the Bankstown branch). Walks were measured on OpenStreetMap foot routing on 2026-11-01 and rounded. A venue counts if its walk is within max_walk_minutes or it is marked include; venues not listed never count, so a new venue is not guessed onto the Metro. Matched against the folded venue name and address, longest match first.",
